OL,5,G0232 Assignment
OL,6,     FHungary under Viktor Orban was a
OL,7,     Fmodel for the populist right the
OL,8,     Fworld over. How has Hungary
OL,9,     Fchanged since Orban's electoral
OL,10,     Fdefeat in April 2026?
OL,11,G0300 BBC News
OL,12,     FThe latest five minute news
OL,13,     Fbulletin from BBC World Service.
OL,14,G0306 Outlook
OL,15,     FIn 2016 Janay was a journalist in
OL,16,     FLondon and needed footage of the
OL,17,     Fconflict in Syria, so contacted
OL,18,     Fcameraman Habak in Aleppo. What
OL,19,     Ffollowed was a love story neither
OL,20,     Fsaw coming.
